[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0091","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0091.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49844","title":"Apache Log4j API MapMessage JSON 序列化编码漏洞","description":"Apache Log4j API 的 MapMessage JSON 序列化功能在处理非有限 IEEE 754 浮点值（NaN、Infinity、-Infinity）时存在编码缺陷，导致生成的 JSON 不符合 RFC 8259 标准。当应用程序使用 JsonTemplateLayout 的消息解析器或依赖 MapMessage.asJson() 的布局，并记录了包含攻击者可控浮点值的 MapMessage 时，非有限值会被直接输出为裸令牌，造成 JSON 格式错误。该漏洞可能破坏下游日志记录及解析流程，影响 Apache Log4j API 2.13.1 至 2.25.4 版本及 2.26.0 版本，CVSS 评分 6.3，危害等级中危。用户应升级至 2.25.5 或 2.26.1 版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49844"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-10T22:16:42Z","updated":"2026-07-14T20:03:09Z","remediation":"升级 Apache Log4j API 至 2.25.5 或 2.26.1 及以上版本，这两个版本已对非有限浮点值输出符合 RFC 8259 标准的 JSON。如无法立即升级，可在应用层对日志中浮点输入进行校验过滤，避免将 NaN/Infinity 等非有限值传入 MapMessage。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/apache/logging-log4j2/pull/4163","https://logging.apache.org/cyclonedx/vdr.xml","https://logging.apache.org/log4j/2.x/manual/json-template-layout.html#event-template-resolver-message","https://logging.apache.org/security.html#CVE-2026-49844","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c8f1603cb76d37d7aca26a74458e0aff33b0985a/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49844.json","https://github.com/link-it/govway/blob/f01bfb4f0cf07a4cfba608c19cf0af9c99c352f1/resources/doc/src/manuali/vulnerability-management/securityAdvisory/2026/CVE-2026-49844.rst","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/8c8fc2aa7ae119f7163aab3170ab59022c4e4e32/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-49844.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/f351737338813300e479bb1093f35fa5b7893f66/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-49844","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/23e59fd10f7619445bb3ab1ba838f2e531989c40/content/posts/cve-2026-49844.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-49844.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/f9dbeac859d4867f751f33dcefc11254b4d40ccb/data/2026/CVE-2026-49844.json","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/Apache_Log4j_MapMessage_JSON_%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E6%97%A5%E5%BF%97%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5_CVE-2026-49844.toml","https://github.com/apache/security-site/blob/688b49dd77e12d8bea3c3d690f69122f8f07c16a/static/projects/logging/CVE-2026-49844.cve.json","https://github.com/ministryofjustice/hmpps-gradle-spring-boot/blob/6498ddae6cd03f7139cd875bfd8e5c53f7d2934b/release-notes/11.x.md","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-49844"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0091.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0452","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0452.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54063","title":"xuri excelize 工作表解析器无界行索引分配拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Excelize 是一个 Go 语言编写的 Excel 文档读写库，其 checkSheet() 函数在处理 XLSX 文件中的 `<row r=\"N\">` XML 属性时，未对行号值进行有效性校验，直接将攻击者控制的数值作为 make([]xlsxRow, row) 的切片长度参数。攻击者可通过构造特制的 XLSX 文件触发两种拒绝服务变体：当 r=2147483647 时，强制分配约 16GB 内存导致进程被 OOM 杀死；当 r=-1 时，触发切片越界访问导致运行时 panic 崩溃。该漏洞无需身份认证，任何使用受影响版本解析用户上传 XLSX 文件并调用 GetCellValue 等 API 的服务均受影响。已在 v2.11.0 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54063","GHSA-h69g-9hx6-f3v4"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-10T17:16:58Z","updated":"2026-07-16T14:11:27Z","remediation":"立即将 github.com/xuri/excelize/v2 升级至 v2.11.0 或更高版本，该版本在 checkSheet() 中增加了对 `<row r=\"N\">` 属性的边界校验（`r.R < 0` 返回错误，`r.R > TotalRows` 返回 ErrMaxRows）。如无法立即升级，可在解析用户上传的 XLSX 文件前增加文件预处理层，拒绝包含异常行号（r 值超出 1~1048576 范围）的 XML 工作表数据。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/qax-os/excelize/releases/tag/v2.11.0","https://github.com/qax-os/excelize/security/advisories/GHSA-h69g-9hx6-f3v4","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54063.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54063.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-07-10/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54063.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54063.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/xuri/excelize/v2/CVE-2026-54063.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-54063.md","https://github.com/xuri/excelize-doc/blob/35a371004ff1975f1664c77a9da9ee1df82821cc/en/releases/v2.11.0.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/3b5728f00ee558b9c845d4d9a20f2a9004619429/posts/cve-2026-54063-go-github-com-xuri-excelize-v2.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/648427aa2db027c1629d5ac1fafa487d8d68e08f/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54063.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-54063.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0452.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0618","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0618.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55501","title":"9router 登录暴力破解防护绕过漏洞","description":"9Router 仪表盘登录速率限制器在 `src/lib/auth/loginLimiter.js` 中通过 `X-Forwarded-For` HTTP 请求头识别客户端身份，未验证该头部是否来自可信代理。远程攻击者可在每次登录尝试中伪造不同的 `X-Forwarded-For` 值，使服务端为每个请求分配新的速率限制桶，从而绕过 5 次尝试阈值和渐进式锁定机制，实现无限制的暴力破解攻击。若实例仍使用默认仪表盘密码，攻击者可成功登录获取管理员权限，访问配置的提供商凭证、API 密钥、修改认证设置并创建持久化访问令牌。该漏洞影响 9Router 0.4.80 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.3，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55501","GHSA-7cfm-pqrj-xgq7"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-10T16:16:33Z","updated":"2026-07-10T17:25:46Z","remediation":"立即升级 9router 至 v0.4.80 或更高版本，该版本修复了登录限速器信任 X-Forwarded-For 头的问题。如无法立即升级，在反向代理层（如 Nginx）配置 `proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $remote_addr;` 覆盖不可信客户端传入的标头，或配置 `proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;` 并修改 9router 的 `getClientIp` 函数优先使用 `X-Real-IP` 而非 `X-Forwarded-For`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/decolua/9router/commit/7648c3412b403a29f04967c4b4e9725e228791d4","https://github.com/decolua/9router/releases/tag/v0.4.80","https://github.com/decolua/9router/security/advisories/GHSA-7cfm-pqrj-xgq7","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8ab396be03b208767ce22804ad16877ccef3b54c/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55501.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-55501.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/npm/9router/CVE-2026-55501.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55501.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-10/TIER_2_CVE-2026-55501.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/0c336e1b86972b4210fc8388a318964ce8d85a8e/content/posts/cve-2026-55501.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-55501.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-55501.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7b437709e7540c8c9af0a3ecc5a6f3df80f4ff33/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-7cfm-pqrj-xgq7/GHSA-7cfm-pqrj-xgq7.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/08ea89e8807d0d5cf7150243c834721985237c9e/CVEs_log/2026-07-11_zh.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0618.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0618.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0618.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0617","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0617.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55500","title":"decolua 9Router 敏感信息泄露与数据库接管漏洞","description":"9Router（AI 路由与令牌管理工具）的 `/api/settings/database` 接口存在敏感信息泄露与未授权数据库导入/导出漏洞。该接口仅依赖 JWT 或 CLI 令牌验证，但攻击者可通过默认密码 \"123456\" 获取有效令牌后，利用 GET 请求导出完整数据库，其中包含明文 API 密钥、OAuth 令牌、OIDC 客户端密钥等全部凭据；同时可通过 POST 请求导入任意 JSON 数据，触发数据库全表清空与替换操作，包括覆盖密码哈希值，从而实现完全数据库接管。该漏洞影响 0.4.80 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 9.9，危害等级严重，可导致全部存储机密泄露、数据库完整性破坏及服务可用性丧失。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55500","GHSA-qvfm-67h2-2qfx"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-10T16:16:33Z","updated":"2026-07-10T17:25:46Z","remediation":"立即升级 9Router 至 v0.4.80 或更高版本（commit `0c7c9de00ae3`），该版本已修复 `/api/settings/database` 端点的认证缺陷。如无法立即升级，建议：1) 在反向代理层限制 `/api/settings/database` 路径仅允许白名单 IP 访问；2) 立即修改默认密码 \"123456\" 为强密码；3) 审查并轮换所有已暴露的 API Key 和 OAuth Token。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/decolua/9router/commit/0c7c9de00ae3ab81d6580e3cc368483c4c03f6fd","https://github.com/decolua/9router/releases/tag/v0.4.80","https://github.com/decolua/9router/security/advisories/GHSA-qvfm-67h2-2qfx","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8ab396be03b208767ce22804ad16877ccef3b54c/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55500.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/npm/9router/CVE-2026-55500.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55500.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-10/TIER_2_CVE-2026-55500.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/0c336e1b86972b4210fc8388a318964ce8d85a8e/content/posts/cve-2026-55500.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-55500.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7b437709e7540c8c9af0a3ecc5a6f3df80f4ff33/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-qvfm-67h2-2qfx/GHSA-qvfm-67h2-2qfx.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-55500.json","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/fc6a1124d3138addd694c22c99bb3a008ab167a6/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-55500-9router-is-an-ai-router-token-saver-prior-to-0-4-80-the-api-settings-database-endpoint-allows-full-databa.md","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/08ea89e8807d0d5cf7150243c834721985237c9e/CVEs_log/2026-07-11_en.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0617.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0628","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0628.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55615","title":"Langroid Neo4jChatAgent Cypher 注入漏洞","description":"Langroid Neo4jChatAgent 存在 Cypher 注入漏洞（CVE-2026-55615），该组件将 LLM 生成的 Cypher 查询语句直接传递给 Neo4j 驱动执行，未进行任何输入验证、语句类型白名单或退出机制检查。攻击者可通过直接提示注入或通过 RAG 检索的间接内容影响 LLM 生成的查询文本，从而控制执行的 Cypher 语句。在最低权限配置下，攻击者可实现未授权读取或删除所有图数据，以及利用 LOAD CSV 远程获取功能进行 SSRF 攻击；当服务器启用 APOC 或 dbms.security 存储过程时，攻击者可进一步实现操作系统命令执行和文件系统访问，达到远程代码执行的危害等级。该漏洞与已在 0.63.0 版本修复的 SQLChatAgent 提示注入漏洞（CVE-2026-25879）属于同一缺陷类型，但修复未覆盖 neo4j 模块。厂商已在 0.65.5 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55615","GHSA-2pq5-3q89-j7cc"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-10T00:16:33Z","updated":"2026-07-10T15:49:19Z","remediation":"立即将 langroid 升级至 0.65.5 或以上版本，该版本为 Neo4jChatAgent 添加了 allow_dangerous_operations 配置开关（默认关闭），并对 Cypher 查询执行语句类型白名单和危险操作拦截。同时将 Neo4j 数据库角色权限收窄为最小权限，禁用 APOC 和 dbms.security 存储过程。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/langroid/langroid/commit/5a3097d9dd6378b08ced5480b0caf76cc58d00fa","https://github.com/langroid/langroid/security/advisories/GHSA-2pq5-3q89-j7cc","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/51d0584360aea91ec24eaa996cf02372f54dc185/data/vuln/langroid/CVE-2026-55615.yaml","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/51d0584360aea91ec24eaa996cf02372f54dc185/data/vuln_en/langroid/CVE-2026-55615.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55615.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55615.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55615.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-55615.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2026/CVE-2026-55615.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-55615.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-55615.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/langroid/CVE-2026-55615.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0628.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0588","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0588.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54771","title":"Langroid Langroid handle_message() 缺少发送者校验导致用户注入工具调用漏洞","description":"这是一个影响 Langroid 框架的身份验证漏洞。当应用程序为不信任的用户启用了聊天界面时，如果工具被配置为 `use=False, handle=True`，系统仍然不会对消息发送者进行验证。攻击者可以直接通过聊天接口发送原始工具 JSON，绕过 LLM 的控制，直接触发工具处理器。攻击者无需登录凭据即可执行通过 `handle=True` 注册但 `use=False` 隐藏的工具。Langroid 允许工具处理与 LLM 相同的消息，攻击者可以利用这种设计缺陷，发送构成有效工具 JSON 的聊天消息，从而访问受保护的功能。这可能导致未授权的文件读取、写入或数据库查询，甚至可能访问内部编排工具。尽管 `use=False` 的设置暗示工具对最终用户不可用，但漏洞的存在意味着用户实际上可以直接调用这些工具。这对依赖 Langroid 开发的应用程序构成了严重安全风险，可能导致数据泄露、系统入侵或进一步的服务破坏。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54771","GHSA-gjgq-w2m6-wr5q"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-10T00:16:33Z","updated":"2026-07-10T15:49:19Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Langroid 至 0.65.3 或更高版本（pip install -U langroid）。如暂时无法升级，可在应用层添加消息来源校验，仅允许 Entity.LLM 来源的消息触发工具调用，拦截 Entity.USER 直接发送的工具 JSON 负载。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/langroid/langroid/security/advisories/GHSA-gjgq-w2m6-wr5q","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54771.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54771.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-09/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54771.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/langroid/CVE-2026-54771.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/12ccf92eecf2db493c63630fd06d8245f1d02476/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54771.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/51d0c9e0ce11ffd48a06c5251961beaf423d7c9a/content/posts/cve-2026-54771.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/08d8ef2f5a7b64747f0001a4dc53fbeb5f7b6caa/cve/CVE-2026-54771.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-gjgq-w2m6-wr5q/GHSA-gjgq-w2m6-wr5q.json","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/9cd2bb0b0eb73e13c8961a77b5af61d5a521984f/vulns/langroid/PYSEC-2026-2579.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-54771.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0588.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0587","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0587.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54769","title":"Langroid TableChatAgent 沙箱逃逸导致远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Langroid 是一个构建大语言模型驱动应用的框架，其 TableChatAgent 和 VectorStore 组件在 full_eval=True 模式下使用 Python 的 eval() 函数执行 LLM 生成的代码时，仅将 locals 参数设为空字典 {} 来限制执行环境，但未从 globals 中移除 __builtins__，导致 Python 解释器隐式注入所有内建函数。远程攻击者可通过提示注入（Prompt Injection）构造恶意载荷，利用 __import__('os').system() 等内建函数绕过沙箱限制，在服务器上执行任意系统命令，实现未授权远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Langroid 0.65.2 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。官方已在 0.65.2 版本中通过修复 eval() 调用方式完成修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54769","GHSA-q9p7-wqxg-mrhc"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-10T00:16:33Z","updated":"2026-07-10T15:49:19Z","remediation":"立即升级 Langroid 至 0.65.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 `eval()` 中 `__builtins__` 未显式清理的问题。如无法升级，在调用 `TableChatAgent` 和 `VectorStore` 时设置 `full_eval=False` 禁用 LLM 生成代码的自动执行，并在代码中手动将 `__builtins__` 置空：`eval(code, {**vars, '__builtins__': {}}, {})`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/langroid/langroid/security/advisories/GHSA-q9p7-wqxg-mrhc","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54769.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54769.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-09/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54769.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/langroid/CVE-2026-54769.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/12ccf92eecf2db493c63630fd06d8245f1d02476/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54769.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/21fafa9e1c32a6f1efcffce1ec55e75a26f7806a/nvd/2026/CRITICAL/CVE-2026-54769/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/51d0c9e0ce11ffd48a06c5251961beaf423d7c9a/content/posts/cve-2026-54769.md","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/fc6a1124d3138addd694c22c99bb3a008ab167a6/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-54769-langroid-is-a-framework-for-building-large-language-model-powered-applications.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54769.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-54769.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0587.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0586","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0586.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54760","title":"Langroid SQLChatAgent 危险函数黑名单绕过漏洞","description":"Langroid SQLChatAgent 存在危险函数黑名单绕过漏洞。该组件通过正则表达式黑名单（`_DANGEROUS_SQL_PATTERNS`）结合 `sqlglot` SELECT 语句白名单实现 SQL 注入防护，但正则要求危险函数名后必须紧跟 `\\s*\\(`，而 PostgreSQL 支持通过引号标识符（如 `\"pg_read_file\"(`）、内联注释（如 `pg_read_file/**/(`）或模式限定名（如 `pg_catalog.pg_read_file(`）等等效语法调用同一函数，这些变体可完全绕过正则检测且仍被解析为合法 SELECT 语句。攻击者若能影响 LLM 生成的 SQL 内容，即可诱导 SQLChatAgent 执行 `pg_read_file` 等危险函数，实现服务端任意文件读取。该漏洞影响 Langroid 0.65.1 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54760","GHSA-6xc5-4r68-67fc"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-10T00:16:33Z","updated":"2026-07-10T16:16:33Z","remediation":"立即升级 Langroid 至 0.65.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 SQLChatAgent 中危险函数黑名单的正则绕过问题。如无法立即升级，请将 SQLChatAgent 使用的数据库角色权限降级，移除 pg_read_server_files 等文件读取权限，并确保数据库连接使用最小权限原则，避免使用 superuser 角色。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/langroid/langroid/security/advisories/GHSA-6xc5-4r68-67fc","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54760.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/langroid/CVE-2026-54760.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-09/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54760.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/12ccf92eecf2db493c63630fd06d8245f1d02476/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54760.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/21fafa9e1c32a6f1efcffce1ec55e75a26f7806a/nvd/2026/CRITICAL/CVE-2026-54760/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/51d0c9e0ce11ffd48a06c5251961beaf423d7c9a/content/posts/cve-2026-54760.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-54760.md","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/fc6a1124d3138addd694c22c99bb3a008ab167a6/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-54760-langroid-is-a-framework-for-building-large-language-model-powered-applications.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-6xc5-4r68-67fc/GHSA-6xc5-4r68-67fc.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54760.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0586.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0269","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0269.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-44342","title":"New API 账号绑定跨站请求伪造漏洞","description":"New API（LLM 网关与 AI 资产管理系统）0.12.0-alpha.1 之前版本中，邮箱绑定接口 GET /api/oauth/email/bind 和微信绑定接口 GET /api/oauth/wechat/bind 使用 GET 请求执行账户绑定等状态变更操作，违反 HTTP 方法语义。在会话 Cookie 允许跨站发送的部署环境下，远程攻击者可诱导已登录用户浏览器发起跨站请求，将攻击者控制的邮箱地址或 OAuth 身份绑定至用户账户，导致账户绑定状态被篡改。该漏洞属于跨站请求伪造（CWE-352），CVSS 评分 5.3，危害等级中危。开发者已在 0.12.0-alpha.1 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-44342","GHSA-26v7-h57m-gh9m"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T23:17:05Z","updated":"2026-07-16T16:37:07Z","remediation":"立即升级到 v0.12.0-alpha.1 及以上版本，该版本已将邮箱和微信绑定接口改为 POST 请求并添加 CSRF Token 校验。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层对 /api/oauth/email/bind 和 /api/oauth/wechat/bind 路径拦截 GET 请求，仅允许 POST 方法作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/QuantumNous/new-api/commit/e099117c61391abdf888fb75e382a582e550bd0e","https://github.com/QuantumNous/new-api/releases/tag/v0.12.0-alpha.1","https://github.com/QuantumNous/new-api/security/advisories/GHSA-26v7-h57m-gh9m","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/184a4cd474c4aaa5a27dac20b468f57966faa421/data/vuln/new-api/CVE-2026-44342.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44342.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/4d1eebacb731643a646e28a4f60e64dd753a5ff4/proposals/euvd/CVE-2026-44342.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-44342.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/github.com/QuantumNous/new-api/CVE-2026-44342.yml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-44342.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-44342.json","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/05da64c166d4f0c1282a01018eb34f5a34c00175/data/osv/GO-2026-5929.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/ade01d2e0e3b718f00ee8257bccf82b519181ac8/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-443xx/CVE-2026-44342.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-26v7-h57m-gh9m/GHSA-26v7-h57m-gh9m.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0269.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0269.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0269.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0259","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0259.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-33655","title":"New API 通知URL SSRF防护绕过漏洞","description":"New API（LLM 网关与 AI 资产管理系统）在通知 URL 处理中存在 SSRF 防护绕过漏洞。由于默认配置下 ApplyIPFilterForDomain 未启用，系统对 Webhook、Bark、Gotify 等通知 URL 进行域名校验时仅检查域名黑白名单，而未解析域名对应的 IP 地址并验证其是否属于内网或元数据地址。已认证的普通攻击者可利用此漏洞配置指向内部服务或云元数据接口的主机名，诱使服务器向内部网络发送请求，进而访问敏感信息或横向移动。该漏洞影响 0.12.0-alpha.1 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.7，危害等级高，建议升级至 0.12.0-alpha.1 或更高版本进行修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-33655","GHSA-6qcr-qxgr-m7fv"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T23:17:04Z","updated":"2026-07-16T16:36:20Z","remediation":"立即升级到 v0.12.0-alpha.1 或更高版本，该版本已将 ApplyIPFilterForDomain 默认启用为 true，确保通知 URL 中的主机名被解析后经过 IP 过滤校验。如无法立即升级，在系统设置 → 请求设置中手动开启\"对域名启用 IP 过滤\"选项，同时配置通知 URL 域名白名单限制可用的外部域名，并在网络层面限制出站流量仅允许访问必要的外部服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/QuantumNous/new-api/commit/20399d3c8fcb4e3649d53163eb11940fd6763743","https://github.com/QuantumNous/new-api/releases/tag/v0.12.0-alpha.1","https://github.com/QuantumNous/new-api/security/advisories/GHSA-6qcr-qxgr-m7fv","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/184a4cd474c4aaa5a27dac20b468f57966faa421/data/vuln/new-api/CVE-2026-33655.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2026/33xxx/CVE-2026-33655.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/4d1eebacb731643a646e28a4f60e64dd753a5ff4/proposals/euvd/CVE-2026-33655.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2167857fddab84dfe24129edd6c6319301254e21/2026/33xxx/CVE-2026-33655.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-09/TIER_3_CVE-2026-33655.md","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/234f830f64cdc68cb0704070f7453dab13cb7503/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-33655/README.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/github.com/QuantumNous/new-api/CVE-2026-33655.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-33655.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-33655.md","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/62f018f20b9d742e5172b0bfe0117dd1e316969c/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-33655-new-api-ssrf-protection-bypass-via-unresolved-hostname-in-notification-urls.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0259.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0259.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0820","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0820.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59221","title":"Open WebUI 终端代理路径遍历漏洞","description":"Open WebUI 终端代理路径清理函数 `_sanitize_proxy_path()` 存在路径遍历绕过漏洞。该函数仅对用户输入的路径参数执行最多 8 轮 URL 解码，攻击者可构造 9 层百分号编码的 `../` 序列（如 `%25252E%25252E%25252F`），经 8 轮解码后仍残留编码后的遍历字符，绕过 `posixpath.normpath()` 和 `startswith('..')` 检查，最终由上游服务器解码实现目录穿越。已认证用户利用现有终端连接即可将请求转发至预期路径之外的任意路径，可能导致敏感信息泄露。影响 Open WebUI 0.9.6 至 0.10.0 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.7，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59221","GHSA-frvj-c5qp-xj4w"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T18:16:55Z","updated":"2026-07-10T02:37:15Z","remediation":"立即升级 Open WebUI 至 v0.10.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了 `_sanitize_proxy_path()` 解码深度不足导致的路径遍历绕过问题。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层（如 Nginx）添加规则拦截包含多层 URL 编码的 `../` 路径请求，或暂时禁用终端代理功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/commit/05098d25a58d03738e01c4e85e8852c3b4ad849c","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/pull/26050","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/releases/tag/v0.10.0","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-frvj-c5qp-xj4w","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/5860f042b5c19b8faa0bc408fc348118590651b6/data/vuln/openwebui/CVE-2026-59221.yaml","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/5860f042b5c19b8faa0bc408fc348118590651b6/data/vuln_en/openwebui/CVE-2026-59221.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59221.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59221.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59221.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59221.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/8536e9d1bbb33a321f6d4a80a182400d5e74bd28/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-59221.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59221.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-592xx/CVE-2026-59221.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/77c1c4e2b164ba912ebd6005200ea105caf493c9/reports/2026-07-09/TIER_2_CVE-2026-59221.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0820.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0828","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0828.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59715","title":"Open WebUI Socket.IO 未授权访问协作文档处理程序漏洞","description":"Open WebUI 是一款可扩展、功能丰富的自托管 AI 平台，其 Socket.IO 服务器配置了 `always_connect=True`，且 `ydoc:awareness:update` 和 `ydoc:document:leave` 两个协作文档事件处理程序未进行身份验证检查。未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过 WebSocket 连接，伪造 `user_id` 向协作文档房间广播虚假光标位置、用户状态等意识数据，或发送伪造的用户离开事件，导致 UI 干扰、用户身份冒充及服务器资源耗尽。该漏洞影响 Open WebUI 0.6.16 至 0.10.0 之前版本，CVSS 评分 3.1，危害等级低。已在 0.10.0 版本中修复。","severity":"LOW","score":3.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59715","GHSA-gmfw-g93r-vg53"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T17:17:04Z","updated":"2026-07-10T02:41:47Z","remediation":"立即升级 Open WebUI 至 v0.10.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 Socket.IO 未认证访问问题。如无法立即升级，手动修改 `backend/open_webui/socket/main.py`：将 `always_connect=True` 改为 `False`，并在 `connect` 事件处理器中对未认证连接返回 `False`；同时在 `ydoc:awareness:update` 和 `ydoc:document:leave` 处理器中添加 `SESSION_POOL` 成员身份校验，拒绝未认证客户端的协作文档事件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/commit/22f2fe1ffb66c993dad1e0b2b35514acaed2370e","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/pull/25946","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/releases/tag/v0.10.0","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-gmfw-g93r-vg53","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59715.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59715.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59715.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59715.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/8536e9d1bbb33a321f6d4a80a182400d5e74bd28/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-59715.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59715.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/pypi/open-webui/CVE-2026-59715.yml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-597xx/CVE-2026-59715.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/61334472876cf5ad32f3637a7727b548d9acebb5/content/posts/cve-2026-59715.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c3d516d6bc446725f6492ed800c677df20d0d39c/2026/CVE-2026-59715.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0828.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0826","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0826.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59227","title":"Open WebUI 图片编辑接口授权绕过漏洞","description":"Open WebUI 是一款可扩展、功能丰富且用户友好的自托管 AI 平台。在 0.8.11 至 0.10.0 版本中，`POST /api/v1/images/edit` 接口仅验证用户账户是否已认证，未检查全局图像编辑开关（`ENABLE_IMAGE_EDIT`）和每用户图像生成权限（`features.image_generation`），导致已认证的非管理员用户可绕过管理员设置的权限控制，利用管理员配置的提供商凭证调用服务端图像编辑功能。攻击者只需持有有效非管理员令牌即可触发该漏洞，造成权限绕过和提供商资源被滥用（产生计费请求），但不会泄露跨用户数据或提供商凭证。该漏洞影响 Open WebUI >= 0.8.11, < 0.10.0 版本，已在 v0.10.0 中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59227","GHSA-rqj7-6wrp-6g2g"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T17:17:04Z","updated":"2026-07-14T02:16:57Z","remediation":"升级 Open WebUI 至 v0.10.0 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层限制对 POST /api/v1/images/edit 接口的访问，仅允许管理员 IP 调用该路由。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/commit/e038bab66dec8d17212eec35b5cb6d6b785a4200","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/pull/26009","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/releases/tag/v0.10.0","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-rqj7-6wrp-6g2g","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2026/CVE-2026-59227.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59227.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59227.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59227.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59227.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59227.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/8536e9d1bbb33a321f6d4a80a182400d5e74bd28/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-59227.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59227.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/pypi/open-webui/CVE-2026-59227.yml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-592xx/CVE-2026-59227.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0826.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0826.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0826.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0825","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0825.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59226","title":"Open WebUI 用户停用后自动化任务权限绕过漏洞","description":"Open WebUI 是一款可扩展、功能丰富的自托管 AI 平台，其存在授权机制缺陷漏洞。平台将 `pending` 角色定义为零权限角色，用于新注册用户和已停用用户，正常 HTTP 路由通过 `get_verified_user()` 拒绝 `pending` 角色的访问。然而，自动化调度器在 `execute_automation()` 执行定时任务时，仅重新获取任务所有者信息，未重新校验其角色是否仍为 `user` 或 `admin`，也未检查是否仍持有 `features.automations` 权限；同时 `check_model_access()` 函数仅对精确角色 `user` 执行私有模型 ACL 检查，导致 `pending` 角色绕过该检查。攻击者利用此漏洞，可在账户被停用后仍通过后台调度器继续执行已创建的自动化任务，消耗运营商的模型提供商凭证、配额和共享容量，并绕过私有模型访问控制。该漏洞影响 Open WebUI 0.9.0 至 0.10.0 之前版本，攻击前提是攻击者先前已创建活跃自动化任务且账户随后被停用，CVSS 评分 3.1，危害等级低。已在 0.10.0 版本中修复。","severity":"LOW","score":3.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59226","GHSA-mvx4-532p-xfm9"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T17:17:04Z","updated":"2026-07-10T02:42:18Z","remediation":"立即升级 Open WebUI 至 v0.10.0 或更高版本，该版本在 execute_automation() 中增加了对自动化所有者状态的重新校验，并在 check_model_access() 中为所有非 admin 角色强制执行模型 ACL。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用所有自动化功能（关闭 Settings > Automations 开关），或移除可疑 pending 用户的自动化配置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/commit/920b655f4689e2118de928fbc936f6ebd4fed396","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/pull/26047","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/releases/tag/v0.10.0","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-mvx4-532p-xfm9","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59226.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59226.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59226.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59226.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/8536e9d1bbb33a321f6d4a80a182400d5e74bd28/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-59226.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59226.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/pypi/open-webui/CVE-2026-59226.yml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-592xx/CVE-2026-59226.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/61334472876cf5ad32f3637a7727b548d9acebb5/content/posts/cve-2026-59226.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/74a5eea2f8e7bbf8745be52f073af8f9cdbbb080/2026/CVE-2026-59226.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0825.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0824","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0824.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59225","title":"Open WebUI Arena 任务端点访问控制绕过漏洞","description":"Open WebUI 是一款自托管 AI 平台，其 0.8.12 至 0.10.0 版本中存在授权绕过漏洞。已认证的非管理员用户若拥有对 arena 包装模型的读取权限，可通过任务端点（如 /api/v1/tasks/moa/completions）直接调用底层受限模型。漏洞根源在于任务路由直接调用 utils.chat.generate_chat_completion()，arena 回退解析在包装模型访问检查后以 bypass_filter=True 递归分发，跳过了对所选子模型的访问权限校验。攻击者无需交互即可利用该漏洞查询管理员限制访问的模型，导致机密信息泄露及 API 配额消耗。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.4，影响范围包括所有使用 Open WebUI 且配置了 arena 模型访问控制的部署实例。官方已在 v0.10.0 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59225","GHSA-m3qf-58wf-w979"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T17:17:03Z","updated":"2026-07-10T02:44:19Z","remediation":"立即升级 Open WebUI 至 v0.10.0 或更高版本（对应 commit dc4924b66e655b315e3be4430a3e51b7d5c20acc）。如无法立即升级，可临时移除非管理员用户的 arena wrapper 模型读取权限，或通过反向代理限制对 /api/v1/tasks/moa/completions 等任务端点的非管理员访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/commit/dc4924b66e655b315e3be4430a3e51b7d5c20acc","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/pull/26046","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/releases/tag/v0.10.0","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-m3qf-58wf-w979","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59225.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59225.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59225.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59225.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/8536e9d1bbb33a321f6d4a80a182400d5e74bd28/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-59225.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59225.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/pypi/open-webui/CVE-2026-59225.yml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-592xx/CVE-2026-59225.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/61334472876cf5ad32f3637a7727b548d9acebb5/content/posts/cve-2026-59225.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/74a5eea2f8e7bbf8745be52f073af8f9cdbbb080/2026/CVE-2026-59225.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0824.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0824.toml"}]